            "review_title": "Review at Oc Chi Em",
            "review_text": "Aii W\n3 contributions\n1\nBad service\nFeb 2018 • Friends\nI just want to give my feedback to you when visit your shop today. It’s really bad experience and we were disappointed about your staff.\n\nWhen we placed order more food for 2nd round, your staff didn’t want us to order more. He came and stopped another staff who was writing order for us. He explained today is nearly Lunar New Year and he begged us to come back by Mung 6 Tet. \nWe understood and ordered only 2 dishes more.\nThen while we were eating, he came and mentioned we had only 10 mins to finish our meals because they will closed at 8.10PM. That’s time is 7.57PM.\nHe made our feeling is like we were begging for foods. We were really upset and we cannot continue eating although there were a lot of food on the table.\nThought, if you decide to open your shop till 28 Tet, please serve your customers with respectability. \nWe ARE NOT begging for foods!\nRead more\nWritten February 13, 2018",
