            "review_title": "Review at Oc Chi Em",
            "review_text": "Withawin L.\n12 contributions\n0\nExotic Place with good taste of Clams\nDec 2017 • Friends\nThis shop is located on the third floor of one building in center of HCM.\n\nThe shop itself has an exotic decoration as it location.\n\nThe shop main dishes are clam as per the name “Oc” in Vietnam means clam.\n\nThere are many shop like this which focus on the clam dish in HCM and also Hanoi.\n\nThis shop provide good taste and flesh clam dish but the price will be a bit high if compare to other local shop and also its location in center of HCM.\n\nOther dishes except clam also good which average price.\n\nI really recommend this shop for every tourist who visit HCM in order to know more about Vietnamese cuisine.\nRead more\nWritten February 6, 2018",
