            "review_title": "Review at Oc Chi Em",
            "review_text": "JunnieVN\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam78 contributions\n0\nThe unique rooftop Snails, claims and Seafood\nDec 2016 • Friends\nWarning: snails, claims in Vietnam is only for adventurous tourist ! \n\nThey have so many kind of snails and claims. Basically they are all good. \nThe common way is: steam with lemon grass, Thai-style steam for claims, stir fired in garlic, stir fired with butter-cheese dressing, chilly salty stir fried, bbq with chilly salt/green onion/cheese \nAnd many more 😅\nThe taste is so easy going, for someone who still give it a thought. Nah, it is very friendly taste, if ya not sure, take the butter dressing/ garlic stir fried snail. \nFor someone who like sweet-n-sour, they have perfect taste available for most of snails. \nYah in conclusion, \nYou pick snail type, then choose the way to cook it. \nPretty kool. \nBread are available on the side and go with all dressing. \nHave fun check out the very unique local Rooftop Snail in Saigon. \nYou wouldn't find any place like this in at least Indochine Countries.\nRead more\nWritten February 7, 2017",
