            "review_title": "Review at Oc Chi Em",
            "review_text": "Mike\nDetroit, Michigan22 contributions\n0\nGreat seafood with complex flavors\nJun 2016 • Couples\nMy wife and I came here as we wanted \"Vietnamese\", \"local\", and seafood and saw it on TA. Few other options existed around the embassy district.\n\nThe atmosphere is interesting and quirky on a rooftop with occasional visits from geckos!\n\nWe used Facebook photos to order and actually only knew what half the dishes were for sure, but it consisted of clams, scallops, snails, etc in sauces like butter w/ pork fat and salt/pepper lime.\n\nGive it a try!\nRead more\nWritten June 25, 2016",
