            "review_title": "Review at Oc Chi Em",
            "review_text": "Kieran W\nCounty Dublin, Ireland18 contributions\n0\nSatisfy your cravings for Oc!\nOct 2015 • Friends\nOc Chi Em is owned by the same people who run Secret Garden and Mountain Retreat, and it follows the same formula as its sibling restaurants (i.e. a hidden rooftop restaurant, nicely decorated, offering Vietnamese cuisine in a slightly-cleaner-than-street-food environment) and specializes in snails, crustaceans, and shellfish. I recommend the so diep nuong mo hanh (grilled scallops with peanuts), cua ot va muoi (grilled crab claws with chili and salt), and ngheu hap xa (steamed clams with lemongrass and chili). It won't break the bank either!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten November 12, 2015",
